ext-gray-300 hover:border-gray-700 hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap w-4 h-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate\">Marksheet</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl border text-xs font-medium flex items-center gap-2 transition-all bg-gray-950/80 border-gray-800 text-gray-300 hover:border-gray-700 hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award w-4 h-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg><span class=\"truncate\">Certificate</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl border text-xs font-medium flex items-center gap-2 transition-all bg-gray-950/80 border-gray-800 text-gray-300 hover:border-gray-700 hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file w-4 h-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate\">Other File</span></button></div></div><div class=\"space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-gray-800/80\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><label class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300\">Target Dimensions (Pixels):</label><span class=\"text-[11px] text-blue-400 font-mono\">200<!-- --> × <!-- -->230<!-- --> px</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><div><span class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400 block mb-1\">Width (px)</span><input type=\"number\" placeholder=\"e.g. 200\" class=\"w-full bg-gray-950 text-white px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 text-sm font-mono focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500\" value=\"200\"/></div><div><span class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-400 block mb-1\">Height (px)</span><input type=\"number\" placeholder=\"e.g. 230\" class=\"w-full bg-gray-950 text-white px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 text-sm font-mono focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500\" value=\"230\"/></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[11px]\"><span class=\"text-gray-500 self-center mr-1\">Presets:</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded-md transition-colors\">200 × 230 (SSC/Bank Photo)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded-md transition-colors\">140 × 60 (Standard Sig)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded-md transition-colors\">350 × 350 (UPSC)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded-md transition-colors\">350 × 450 (RRB/Passport)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded-md transition-colors\">240 × 240 (Thumb Print)</button></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2 border-t border-gray-800/80\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300 block\">Target File Format:</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-1.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold font-mono border transition-all bg-emerald-600 border-emerald-500 text-white shadow-md\">JPG</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold font-mono border transition-all bg-gray-950 border-gray-800 text-gray-300 hover:text-white\">PNG</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold font-mono border transition-all bg-gray-950 border-gray-800 text-gray-300 hover:text-white\">PDF</button></div></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300 block\">Target File Size Range (KB):</label><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" placeholder=\"Min KB\" class=\"w-full bg-gray-950 text-white px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 text-sm font-mono focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500\" value=\"20\"/><span class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs font-bold\">TO</span><input type=\"number\" placeholder=\"Max KB\" class=\"w-full bg-gray-950 text-white px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 text-sm font-mono focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500\" value=\"50\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[11px] pt-1\"><span class=\"text-gray-500 self-center mr-1\">Size Presets:</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded-md transition-colors\">20–50 KB (SSC Photo)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded-md transition-colors\">10–20 KB (SSC Signature)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded-md transition-colors\">50–100 KB (Declaration)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded-md transition-colors\">20–300 KB (UPSC)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"bg-gray-950 hover:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded-md transition-colors\">50–500 KB (Certificates)</button></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2 border-t border-gray-800/80\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300 block flex items-center justify-between\"><span>Aspect Ratio &amp; Crop Mode:</span></label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-2 px-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium border flex items-center justify-center gap-1 transition-all bg-blue-600 border-blue-500 text-white shadow-md\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-crop w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14\"></path><path d=\"M18 22V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2\"></path></svg><span>Fill Padding</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-2 px-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium border flex items-center justify-center gap-1 transition-all bg-gray-950 border-gray-800 text-gray-300 hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-crop w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14\"></path><path d=\"M18 22V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2\"></path></svg><span>Center Crop</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-2 px-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium border flex items-center justify-center gap-1 transition-all bg-gray-950 border-gray-800 text-gray-300 hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-crop w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14\"></path><path d=\"M18 22V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2\"></path></svg><span>Stretch Exact</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-2 px-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium border flex items-center justify-center gap-1 transition-all bg-gray-950 border-gray-800 text-gray-300 hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-crop w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14\"></path><path d=\"M18 22V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2\"></path></svg><span>Visual Manual Crop</span></button></div></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-gray-300 block flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-palette w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22a1 1 0 0 1 0-20 10 9 0 0 1 10 9 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-2.25a1.75 1.75 0 0 0-1.4 2.8l.3.4a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.4 2.8z\"></path><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg>Background Color (For Padding):</label><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 py-1.5 rounded-xl border text-xs font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all border-blue-500 bg-gray-800 text-white\"><span class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full border border-gray-600\" style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF\"></span><span>White</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 py-1.5 rounded-xl border text-xs font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all border-gray-800 bg-gray-950 text-gray-400\"><span class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full border border-gray-600\" style=\"background-color:#F3F4F6\"></span><span>Gray</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 py-1.5 rounded-xl border text-xs font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all border-gray-800 bg-gray-950 text-gray-400\"><span class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full border border-gray-600\" style=\"background-color:#000000\"></span><span>Black</span></button></div></div></div></div></div><button disabled=\"\" class=\"w-full py-4 rounded-2xl font-extrabold text-base flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 transition-all shadow-xl bg-gray-800 text-gray-500 cursor-not-allowed border border-gray-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-5 h-5 text-amber-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Process &amp; Format Document Now</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 space-y-6\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-900 border border-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-white\">3</span>Live Result &amp; Verification</h2><div class=\"bg-gray-900/50 border border-gray-800 border-dashed rounded-2xl p-10 text-center text-gray-500 space-y-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-gray-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sliders-horizontal w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 5H3\"></path><path d=\"M12 19H3\"></path><path d=\"M14 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 17v4\"></path><path d=\"M21 12h-9\"></path><path d=\"M21 19h-5\"></path><path d=\"M21 5h-7\"></path><path d=\"M8 10v4\"></path><path d=\"M8 12H3\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-gray-300 text-sm\">Preview Will Appear Here</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 max-w-xs mx-auto\">Upload your document on the left, adjust specifications, and click <strong>Process &amp; Format Document Now</strong>.</p></div></div></div><section class=\"mt-16 border-t border-gray-800/80 pt-12 space-y-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"name\":\"FitMyForm - Student Document Resizer & Formatter\",\"url\":\"https://fitmyform.com\",\"applicationCategory\":\"UtilitiesApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"All\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires JavaScript. Requires HTML5 Canvas.\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\"},\"description\":\"Filing online application forms for SSC CGL, UPSC, IBPS, RRB Railway, CTET, or state competitive exams requires strict adherence to photo size, pixel dimensions, and JPG format limits. FitMyForm is a 100% free, browser-based tool built specifically for Indian students to format documents securely without third-party server uploads.\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Resize Document for Online Application Forms using FitMyForm\",\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Upload Document\",\"text\":\"Select or drop your photo, signature, thumb impression, or certificate.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Configure Form Requirements\",\"text\":\"Select exam preset (SSC, UPSC, Banking, CTET) or enter target width, height, and KB limit.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Process & Download\",\"text\":\"The client-side engine automatically resizes, crops, and compresses your file for instant download.\"}]}</script><div class=\"space-y-4 text-center sm:text-left\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\">Student Guide: Resizing Photos &amp; Documents for Government Forms</h2><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">Filing online application forms for SSC CGL, UPSC, IBPS, RRB Railway, CTET, or state competitive exams requires strict adherence to photo size, pixel dimensions, and JPG format limits. FitMyForm is a 100% free, browser-based tool built specifically for Indian students to format documents securely without third-party server uploads.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-white\">100% Client-Side Privacy</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 leading-normal\">No document is ever uploaded to any cloud server. Your sensitive photos, Aadhaar cards, and signatures remain safely inside your browser.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap w-6 h-6 text-blue-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.914 4a1.5 1.5 0 00-2.474-1.561l-9 9A1.5 1.5 0 005.5 14h4.002a.5.5 0 01.471.666L8.086 20a1.5 1.5 0 002.475 1.56l9-9A1.5 1.5 0 0018.5 10h-3.997a.5.5 0 01-.472-.667z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-white\">High-Precision Compression</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 leading-normal\">Iterative binary search quality adjustments guarantee your file fits exactly inside the required KB window (e.g. 20–50 KB) without blurriness.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text w-6 h-6 text-indigo-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-white\">Official Exam Specs</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 leading-normal\">Pre-loaded requirements database for SSC, UPSC, IBPS, RRB Railway, NTA NEET/JEE, UPTET, CTET, and University Admissions.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-4\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-base text-white\">Standard Indian Exam Document Requirements Cheat Sheet</h3><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full text-xs text-left text-gray-300\"><thead class=\"bg-gray-950 text-gray-400 uppercase font-mono text-[10px]\"><tr><th class=\"p-3\">Exam Portal</th><th class=\"p-3\">Doc Type</th><th class=\"p-3\">Dimensions</th><th class=\"p-3\">Target Size</th><th class=\"p-3\">Format</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-800 font-mono\"><tr><td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-white\">SSC (CGL/CHSL)</td><td class=\"p-3\">Photo</td><td class=\"p-3 text-blue-300\">200 × 230 px</td><td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-400\">20 – 50 KB</td><td class=\"p-3\">JPG / JPEG</td></tr><tr><td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-white\">SSC (CGL/CHSL)</td><td class=\"p-3\">Signature</td><td class=\"p-3 text-blue-300\">140 × 60 px</td><td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-400\">10 – 20 KB</td><td class=\"p-3\">JPG / JPEG</td></tr><tr><td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-white\">UPSC Civil Services</td><td class=\"p-3\">Photo &amp; Sig</td><td class=\"p-3 text-blue-300\">350 × 350 px (Min)</td><td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-400\">20 – 300 KB</td><td class=\"p-3\">JPG / JPEG</td></tr><tr><td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-white\">IBPS Banking</td><td class=\"p-3\">Left Thumb</td><td class=\"p-3 text-blue-300\">240 × 240 px</td><td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-400\">20 – 50 KB</td><td class=\"p-3\">JPG / JPEG</td></tr><tr><td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-white\">Railway RRB</td><td class=\"p-3\">Passport Photo</td><td class=\"p-3 text-blue-300\">350 × 450 px</td><td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-400\">20 – 50 KB</td><td class=\"p-3\">JPG / JPEG</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-lg text-white flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-5 h-5 text-blue-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h3><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-white text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Is it safe to upload sensitive documents like Aadhaar card, photo, and signature on FitMyForm?</span></h4><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 pl-6 leading-relaxed\">Yes, 100% safe. FitMyForm processes all images and PDFs entirely inside your web browser using client-side JavaScript HTML5 Canvas and Blob APIs. Your files are never sent or stored on any server.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-white text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>How do I resize a passport photo to 200 x 230 pixels and 20–50 KB for SSC?</span></h4><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 pl-6 leading-relaxed\">Simply click &quot;SSC Passport Photo&quot; preset or select Width: 200 px, Height: 230 px, Min KB: 20, Max KB: 50, Format: JPG. Upload your photo and click Process. FitMyForm will iteratively adjust quality to ensure your file falls exactly within 20 to 50 KB.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-white text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Why does my signature image get rejected on online portals?</span></h4><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 pl-6 leading-relaxed\">Online portals reject signatures if they exceed KB limits (usually max 20 KB), have wrong aspect ratio (standard is 140x60 px), or contain colored background clutter. FitMyForm automatically trims borders and pads white background.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-white text-sm flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Does FitMyForm work on mobile phones?</span></h4><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 pl-6 leading-relaxed\">Yes! FitMyForm works on all Android and iOS smartphones. You can take a photo directly from your camera or select an image from gallery.</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"w-full bg-gray-950 border-t border-gray-800/80 text-gray-400 py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-20\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8\"><div class=\"space-y-4 md:col-span-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg\">F</div><span class=\"font-extrabold text-lg text-white\">FitMyForm</span></div><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-400\">Free student document resizer &amp; formatter. Tailored for Indian government competitive exams, college admissions, and job forms.</p><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-3 text-emerald-300 text-xs\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><strong>100% Client-Side Privacy:</strong> Your sensitive Aadhaar cards, photos, and signatures never leave your device.</span></div></div><div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-white text-sm mb-3 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-blue-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Quick Resizer Tools</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-xs\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/photo-resizer\">Passport Photo Resizer</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/signature-resizer\">Signature Resizer &amp; Formatter</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/image-compressor\">Compress Image to 20 KB - 50 KB</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/image-to-jpg\">Convert PNG / WEBP to JPG</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/pdf-compressor\">Client-Side PDF Size Reducer</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-white text-sm mb-3 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg>Exam Photo Formats</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-xs\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/ssc-photo-resizer\">SSC CGL / CHSL Photo Resizer (200x230)</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/uptet-photo-resizer\">UPTET Photo &amp; Signature Maker</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/ctet-photo-resizer\">CTET Photo Resizer (10-100 KB)</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/presets\">UPSC Photo &amp; Signature (350x350)</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/presets\">IBPS Bank Photo &amp; Thumb Impression</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-white text-sm mb-3\">Guidelines &amp; Help</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-xs\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/resize-photo-for-online-form\">How to Resize Photos for Online Forms</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/presets\">View All Exam Requirements Database</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/dashboard\">My Recent Processed Files</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-6 border-t border-gray-800/60 text-center text-xs text-gray-400 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4\"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> FitMyForm. Built for Indian Students &amp; Applicants.</p><p class=\"flex items-center gap-1 justify-center\">Crafted with <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-500 fill-rose-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg> for fast &amp; error-free form submissions.</p></div></footer></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[52683,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1b0uuqdaqgtgz.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2g-x0fkmcw_8e.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1i5cdse598k2_.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n6:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\n9:I[97367,[\\\"/_next